[transport-contract] Transport and journal ownership contract (complete)
Files: proposals/transport-and-journal.md; proposals/input-and-interaction.md; proposals/presentation-host.md
Do: Record the single vocabulary and ownership boundary for transport envelopes, ordered semantic batches, membership views, source adapters, Stage/Orchestrator admission, JournalWriter timestamps, and immutable branches. Remove competing candidate contracts from adjacent documents.
Accept: The proposal is the only normative design record for reusable transport/journal semantics; current InputPacketSet behavior is labeled as a prototype specialization; host and input documents link to it without redefining it.
