[batch-model] Ordered semantic batch model (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/input.rs; crates/caravan-demo/src/orchestrator.rs; proposals/transport-and-journal.md; tests/**
Do: Design the smallest identity-bearing ordered batch and derived membership view that can represent repeated observations, press/release order, replay, and network-shaped out-of-order delivery without exposing transport objects to InteractionDefinition. Preserve the current set prototype until migration evidence exists.
Accept: Identity, duplicate, order, source-merge, retention, and view semantics are executable and deterministic; current state-aware interaction behavior remains covered; no host timestamp or mutable authoritative state is introduced.
