[journal-operations] Journal operation bridge (complete)
Files: crates/engine-journal/**; crates/engine-branches/**; crates/caravan-demo/src/orchestrator.rs; proposals/transport-and-journal.md
Do: Map ordered-batch admission onto JournalWriter, actual publication, counterfactual construction, and corrected suffix construction. Keep timestamps journal-owned and late observations value-producing through immutable branches.
Accept: Accepted observations publish new immutable values, rejected observations preserve the selected parent, late observations use explicit branch policy, and transport identity never assigns LogicalTime.
