[buffer-lifecycle] Input buffer window lifecycle (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/input.rs; crates/caravan-demo/src/orchestrator.rs; crates/caravan-demo/tests/input.rs; crates/caravan-demo/src/host/application.rs\nDo: Implement Orchestrator-owned InputBuffer and immutable InputWindow lifecycle over normalized OrderedInputBatch values. Keep transport FIFO separate from semantic retention; resolve captured windows explicitly as Retain, Consume, or Discard; retain windows when projection or publication fails; consume accepted transformations; discard successful no-ops.\nAccept: Later arrivals are not consumed by an earlier window; lifecycle behavior is deterministic and executable; current membership-view interaction behavior remains green; and host transport does not expose buffer policy.
